        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To get an accurate quote, provide your full address, inventory list, and preferred moving date through our online estimate form or call our local office. Our system calculates distance, vehicle type, and packing requirements, then delivers a transparent, item‑by‑item cost breakdown within minutes, ensuring no hidden fees.</p>
