        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We offer 100% IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering loss, theft, or damage for the entire value of your belongings. You can choose the basic coverage included in the price or upgrade to a higher declared value plan for added peace of mind, with claim processing handled swiftly.</p>
