      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why is IBA approval important when selecting Packers And Movers In Tambaram?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA approval means the mover adheres to a strict code of ethics, financial stability, and service standards set by the Indian Banks Association. This accreditation protects you from fraud, ensures transparent billing, and guarantees that the company can meet contractual obligations, especially for corporate or government relocations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time while it travels from Tambaram to the destination hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every truck in our fleet is equipped with satellite GPS that streams live location data to our customer portal. You receive a unique tracking ID and can monitor progress, estimated arrival time, and any check‑post delays, giving you full visibility throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the main factors influencing the cost matrix for moving from Tambaram?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is driven by distance, volume of goods, type of vehicle required, level of packing (standard vs. 7‑layer), insurance coverage, and any special handling for fragile or high‑value items. Seasonal demand and access constraints (e.g., stairs, elevators) may also affect the final tariff.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging system protect delicate items during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system starts with an 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, stretch film for weatherproofing, and custom wooden crates for extra rigidity. Each layer absorbs shocks, prevents vibration, and shields against moisture, ensuring safe delivery of glass, electronics, and heirlooms.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special permits or documentation required for moving light household articles from Tambaram?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For intra‑state moves, a standard e‑Way bill generated through our platform suffices. For interstate relocations, you’ll need a copy of the GSTIN, identity proof, and a signed packing list. Our team prepares all paperwork, files the necessary permits, and ensures compliance with transport regulations.</p>
